###############################################################################
# Q12 -- Gaps and ambiguities (prose; not triples)
###############################################################################

# - Table I does not say whether errors are on training or test data, so the role is null. Virial RMSEs are in meV/atom (unit null). RMSEs of the PBE-trained NEPs versus cutoff are in Fig. 2 only.
# - The D3 force comparison against VASP for MOF-5, ZIF-8 and HKUST-1 (Fig. 1) checks the D3 implementation, not an MLIP; binding curves and thermal conductivities are property results.
# - Author affiliations are not encoded (ORCIDs are those deposited with the DOI metadata, source: crossref).
# - Evaluation roles and data, base models, inference timings with their system sizes, and the source location of each value are recorded in the encoding input (artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/ying2023.yaml) until the schema has terms for them.

